+From 2c28d6c10fef2ab34270bd90ce2b75207cb951ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Jean Delvare <khali@linux-fr.org>
+Date: Thu, 12 Jan 2012 20:32:03 +0100
